{
 "duration": 27.58,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ana was 300 feet from her first fourteener when the clouds started building.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.891
  },
  {
   "text": "It was barely noon.",
   "start": 5.341,
   "end": 6.384
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Colorado mountains, summer storms often build by early afternoon, and lightning on a bare ridge is no place to be.",
   "start": 6.834,
   "end": 14.366
  },
  {
   "text": "She had set a turnaround time at the trailhead.",
   "start": 14.816,
   "end": 17.04
  },
  {
   "text": "She kept it.",
   "start": 17.49,
   "end": 18.224
  },
  {
   "text": "That night she still filled in the log card and ticked the box that says turned back.",
   "start": 18.674,
   "end": 22.885
  },
  {
   "text": "Next time she started earlier.",
   "start": 23.335,
   "end": 24.932
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next big climb.",
   "start": 25.382,
   "end": 27.38
  }
 ],
